
--------------------------------------------------------------
Common Checked Exceptions(Compile time exceptions: Handling required at compile time )
--------------------------------------------------------------
Exception	                    Typical cause
IOException	                    Input/output operation fails
FileNotFoundException	        File doesn't exist
SQLException	                Database operation problem
ClassNotFoundException	        Class cannot be found
InterruptedException	        Thread is interrupted
ParseException	                Parsing fails
ReflectiveOperationException    Reflection operation fails
NoSuchMethodException	        Requested method doesn't exist
NoSuchFieldException	        Requested field doesn't exist
InstantiationException	        Object cannot be instantiated
IllegalAccessException	        Access is not permitted


------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Common Runtime Exceptions (Run time Exceptions: -No handling required at compile time)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Exception	                        Typical cause
ArithmeticException	                Illegal arithmetic, e.g. divide by zero
NullPointerException	            Using a null reference
ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException	    Invalid array index
StringIndexOutOfBoundsException	    Invalid String index
NumberFormatException	            Invalid String-to-number conversion
ClassCastException	                Invalid type casting
IllegalArgumentException	        Invalid method argument
IllegalStateException	            Method called at an inappropriate state
UnsupportedOperationException	    Operation not supported
NegativeArraySizeException	        Array created with negative size
SecurityException	                Security violation
ConcurrentModificationException	    Collection modified improperly during iteration
IndexOutOfBoundsException	        Invalid index
NoSuchElementException	            Requested element doesn't exist



